        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion A2-0 Contemporary South Beach Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA Fusion made deadbolt, it emulates the style of Miami that is both chic and streamlined.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion A2 Contemporary South Beach Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion A2 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-3/8\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FUS-A2-0.pdf?v=1718159610\" target=\"new\"><b>Specifications of the Fusion A2 Deadbolt (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder</b> -  The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. </b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
